<item><title>ACEP Burkina opens two service points near Ouagadougou markets</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/acep-burkina-opens-two-service-points-near-ouagadougou-7e7d33/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/acep-burkina-opens-two-service-points-near-ouagadougou-7e7d33/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>The microfinance institution opened the counters at Sankar-Yaaré and 10 Yaar on Monday, 16 November 2026, to bring its services closer to market users.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 09:38:02 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" length="35711" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
